description:
Called by the Admin Studio plugin. Sends a Claude Messages API request to the URL held in the "Admin Studio AI Connection" parameter, authenticated with the "Admin Studio AI Key" parameter (x-api-key), and returns the JSON reply.

Trigger input: { "url": "<from Admin Studio AI Connection>", "request": { "model": "...", "max_tokens": 300, "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "..." } ] } }
Output: the HTTP step's statusCode and body (the Claude message JSON) in the execution history.
